  "description": "Generates human-friendly, prefixed, time-ordered entity identifiers such as usr_01k2f9v8ta7m3x0qbrn4dzeh5c. Each ID carries a per-entity prefix so you can tell what it identifies at a glance, followed by a lowercase ULID (default) or UUIDv7 so IDs sort by creation time and index well. Prefixes are registered once at DI setup, eliminating magic strings and catching collisions at startup.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "UserFriendlyIds",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-07T06:55:30.15Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
