  "packageSize": 90072,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/SrKleRAimBot/UserFriendlyIds",
  "published": "2026-08-07T06:52:57.28Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 - Initial release.\n\n      * Identifiers of the form <prefix>_<value>, for example usr_01k2f9v8ta7m3x0qbrn4dzeh5c.\n      * Entity prefixes registered once at DI setup; duplicates and malformed prefixes fail at start-up.\n      * ULID values by default (26 characters), or UUIDv7 (32 characters) via UseUuidV7().\n      * Time-ordered: identifiers sort by creation time as plain strings. ULIDs are strictly\n        monotonic per thread, including within a millisecond and across backwards clock steps.\n      * One allocation per identifier. Roughly 30ns for ULID and 46ns for UUIDv7, against 226ns\n        for Guid.NewGuid().ToString().\n      * Targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Trimming and AOT compatible.",
